    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Phase 3: Knowledge Retrieval\n**Store:** Qdrant (`agent_transcripts`).\n**Embeddings:** Google Gemini.\n**Mechanism:** Converts the question into vectors -> Finds similar text chunks in the database -> Returns context to the AI.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 1176,
